---
name: Cisco ISE syslog over UDP → topic
description: |
  Receives Cisco ISE remote-target syslog over UDP, one segment per datagram,
  reassembles segmented messages, and publishes parsed events to `cisco`.
---

accept_udp "0.0.0.0:514"
// A datagram with a priority but an unusual header is still a segment.
this = data.parse_syslog(accept_pri_only=true)
body = move content? else message?
category = app_name? if app_name?.starts_with("CISE_")
where body != null
// Segments arrive one by one. Batches keep up with many messages per second.
batch timeout=250ms
cisco::ise::reassemble message=body, category=category
drop category
cisco::ise::parse message=body
publish "cisco"
